# windOS Zen — KDE Plasma edition package list (Debian 13 Trixie)
# Installed when the user picks "KDE Plasma Edition" in Calamares.
# All names verified present in Trixie (incl. arc-kde: "Port of the popular
# GTK theme Arc for Plasma Desktop"). Deliberately minimal: kde-plasma-desktop
# (not full kde-standard) to keep the telemetry surface small; the extras
# below are the file manager, terminal, Arc Qt/KDE theme, and Papirus icons.
# Background sync/telemetry daemons are neutralized in install-kde-edition.sh.
kde-plasma-desktop
dolphin
konsole
arc-theme
arc-kde
papirus-icon-theme
